Google's search results page is a complex layout that requires a responsive design to ensure a seamless user experience across different screen sizes and devices. To achieve this, I would utilize CSS Grid, a powerful layout system that allows for efficient and flexible arrangement of components. In this answer, I will outline my approach to implementing a responsive design for Google's search results page using CSS Grid.

